<title>USA: Electropharmacology CEO resigns.</title>
<headline>Electropharmacology CEO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>POMPANO BEACH, Fla. 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electropharmacology Inc said on Thursday that Joseph Mooibroek resigned as chairman, president, shief executive and board member of the company.</p>
<p>The company said it has named Arup Sen chairman, president and CEO.</p>
<p>Sen was executive vice president of research, development, regulatory and clinical studies for the company.</p>
